              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bheka, intombi iyakukhulelwa, izale indodana, bayiqambe igama lokuthi u-Emanuweli, okungukuthi ngokuhunyushwa, uNkulunkulu unathi.",
          "type": "text",
